@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Optional AI chat and reviewed edits
autonumber
actor Author
participant "Workspace UI" as UI
participant "AiService\nC#" as AI
participant "IAiProvider\nC# adapter" as Adapter
participant "Ollama OR\nGemini / Claude" as Provider
participant "ChangeReviewService" as Review
Author -> UI : select source / diagnostics; ask question
UI -> AI : prepare context from revision R
AI --> UI : exact context + provider / model disclosure
UI --> Author : preview context and destination
Author -> UI : approve and provide credential if required
UI -> AI : approved AiRequest(R)
AI -> Adapter : RespondAsync(request, cancellation)
Adapter -> Provider : direct browser request; no proxy
alt provider available and authorized
  loop streamed response
    Provider --> Adapter : response chunk
    Adapter --> AI : AiEvent
    AI --> UI : safe display-only text
  end
  Provider --> Adapter : completion
  Adapter --> AI : completed text / proposed edits
  AI -> AI : validate proposal schema and source spans
  opt valid source-edit proposal
    AI -> Review : ChangeSet(baseRevision=R, origin=AI)
    Review --> UI : preview; explicit acceptance required
  end
else auth / CORS / model / quota / network failure
  Provider --> Adapter : error or browser rejects request
  Adapter --> AI : sanitized typed failure
  AI --> UI : explain error; no cloud fallback
end
note over AI, Provider
Cancel aborts the request; partial output never changes files.
Credentials and chat remain in memory; disconnect clears references.
Local-to-cloud switching requires new user approval.
end note
@enduml
